                        




An instance of SCP-5134 being contained.



Item #:  SCP-5134

Object Class:  Euclid (Reclassification to Keter pending further testing)

Special Containment Procedures: 

A dragnet of public-private-partnerships between the NSA, the Foundation and various social media corporations enforcing the continuous operation of bots to prevent any piece of media on the internet from having 13 Likes for any length of time exceeding approximately 357 nanoseconds. The prevention of the creation of SCP-5134-A series subjects in addition to the extant (and terminated) first 7 affections, through enforcement of black-outs across major social media companies, of any information about the phenomenon.

Any product managers, business intelligence analysts, data scientists or hobbyist bot developers who visualize the data regarding SCP-5134, will have a 50% probability of beginning to exhibit anomalous tendencies within a few weeks of consciously recognizing the correlation, and a 90% probability within three months. These persons must be detected and treated with grade-O amnesiacs via daily microdosing, and are generally terminated (from their existing employment contracts, a Foundation-approved recruiter acts as a corridor for getting “better offers” from Google, where they take up future employment). There are concerns about the budgeting of the Foundation’s agreement with Google should the manifestations of SCP-5134-infected professionals (and hobbyists) continue in the future or begin to evidence an exponential rate. The counter-memetics are monitored by advanced pattern recognition AI employed in partnership with the NSA, who enhances the AI’s intuitive capabilities via the Foundation’s leasing of a proxy virtual machine interfacing with SCP-079. A network of Foundation-managed bots counter any attempt by an SCP-5134 infected person from unleashing botnets to increase the running count of media with 13 Likes.

Description: 

SCP-5134 is a global effect where social media posts having exactly 13 Likes for some periods of time increases the statistical tendency of horrible events relating to the posts occurring in the real world. Some Foundation theorists consider it a manifestation of a new trend of digitally-defined anomalies, others consider it a Strange Attractor baked into statistics, and also a third school, consider it a projection of the collective power of superstitions, social media outrage and self-fulfilling prophecies.

Whatever the underlying explanation for SCP-5134, it is an undeniable [redacted] in the statistical patterns in disease, injuries and fatalities from political violence, locust-related famine, and the use of prison camps by authoritarian governments. While many people in the world might observe those statistical trends, only those who study the visualized correlation between [redacted] and [redacted] could come to believe the otherwise extremely improbable notion that posts with 13 Likes act as resonators of ruinous causation, or somehow contribute to these events occurrences. Of the 7 subjects the Foundation has detained, most report having gone through an intermediate phase of feeling intensely curious about how much a mimetic effect, general sharing of awful news on social media, may have on the perpetuation of horrible events, and contrast that estimated effect against any more notable correlations with 13 Likes posts specifically. Three out of seven were found to have furious notes scribbled in .txt format, where they inner monologue their skepticism of SCP-5134. It seems different people engage with SCP-5134 psychologically in distinct ways and that, coupled with early detection and intervention, a person can escape becoming anomalous.

The point of no return comes once the curiosity is satisfied and projected in some kind of visual format. The running conjecture is that SCP-5134 used the visualization as an infohazard vector to effect the creation of SCP-5134-A instances (serially referred to as -1 through -n). Once affected, the subjects became obsessed with optimizing the number of posts with 13 Likes across the internet, and began acting subversively, returning to their jobs only to gain permissioned API access and spending almost all of their time, to the exclusion of hygiene, regular sleep or interpersonal relations, working on bots to continue to subvert their target network and continued to manifest SCP-5134 more strongly. The requirement of knowing about SCP-5134 without knowing enough to begin the slippery slope towards research curiosity, which could lead to an agent becoming compromised, led to the public-private partnership and its compartmentalization of key information about SCP-5134 between cleared personnel.

Addendum-1: 

The current inquiry involves:

#1To what extent it is possible to maintain early detection and treatment of at risk persons, to forget about their curiosity regarding the veracity of SCP-5134, followed by job placement at Google, in order for the actuaries to estimate future expected Foundation co-pays.

#2 What is the threshold of knowledge about SCP-5134 that leads to a person becoming curious about exposure to the anomaly. We have learned after the infections of Agent [redacted] and Dr. [redacted], who became SCP-5134-6 and SCP-5134-7 respectively, that the threshold requires partitioning. SCP-5134-7 became curious after reading the SCP 5134 file draft, which was written by SCP-5134-6. The current file draft contains redactions of text written by SCP-5134-7, which were themselves a trap to initiate curiosity. Therefore out of 5 “keybearers” holding either differently-redacted versions of this file, or encryption keys to decrypt other versions, 2 or 3 are currently involved in an experiment to determine the line where curiosity becomes dangerous. (Do not fear, this file is not one of them - if you do not feel any curiosity you are safe, if you experience curiosity about SCP-5134, please contact a Foundation affiliated therapist for a confidential disclosure.)

#3 Whether or not SCP-5134 can be utilized to effect breakthroughs in energy technology or other positive outcomes.

#4 The difference between 13 Likes and 13 Retweets and also 13 Quote Tweets, and whether or not the tone of the QT’s, both pro-thematically and counter-thematically, has any effect on SCP-5134 . The experiment is being done with Class-D personnel using a combination of easy Social Media Spamming tools, manual intuitive retweeting, and Tableau tutorials. As those involved in inquiry d) are liable to become SCP-5134 -8++ this experiment is being done in our [redacted] compound outside of [redacted] just south of the [redacted] campus, all subjects are liable for termination but only if experimentation with amnesiacs proves useless for containing the

analogy anomaly.

Addendum-2: 

SCP-5134 -6 and SCP-5134 -7 both represent a vertical, sequential climbing of the Foundation’s chain of command. The chain of command in regards to this containment operation has been refactored, however the ability of SCP-5134 to possibly target for infection persons with lateral access in our chain of command is worrying and must be subject to regular audit.

Addendum-3:  Follow up [11-__-2020]:

After 8 months of containment, it seems as if the negative effects of SCP-5134 have fallen dramatically, with political violence, infectious disease and locust famines being significantly reduced from 1 year prior.

